{"slug":"Discord","title":"Discord","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Description","text":"Description","level":2},{"id":"See_also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Description\">Description</h2></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Bottom_Footer.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"941\" data-file-height=\"46\"><figcaption>Footer of <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront.io\">OpenFront.io</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Discord</span> is the main communication channel chosen by the developers and community.\n</p><p>At the bottom footer on <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront.io\">OpenFront.io</a> you will find a link to join the official <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" class=\"\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a> <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Discord</span> server.\n</p><p><br>\nThere is a separate <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Discord</span> for developers. You can find it through the GitHub page for <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" class=\"\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"See_also\">See also</h2></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" class=\"\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a></li></ul>","section":"Meta & community"}
